mber/1874w\">1874w</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-04 03:39:32 +08:00\">17h 42m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>我没啥感觉，反而觉得 6.1 Sol 是真耐用，半天掉了 5% 左右（ 5x 订阅），反正都能干活，也没必要用 Astra</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18147348\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/2651d2e06496c1ef4e0e9e10081dc183?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"jko123\" data-uid=\"222376\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>9</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/jko123\">jko123</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-04 10:32:42 +08:00\">10h 49m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>Astra+6.1SOl 搭配用，挺耐用的，5x 1 天不到 10%额度</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18147396\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/3fa8/290f/112740_normal.png?m=1776386282\" alt=\"willxiang\" data-uid=\"112740\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>10</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/willxiang\">willxiang</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-04 11:11:34 +08:00\">10h 10m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>我感觉速度慢极了，平时 2-3 分钟能干完的事情，现在 10 分钟过去了还在思考中</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18147578\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/349ee113a5ce133d39f10150048972ef?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"qi1070445109\" data-uid=\"201494\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n          